WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.625
An encumbrance certificate is a scoped search of registered transaction indexes. Record the office, property keys, and years.

00:00:09.625 --> 00:00:18.917
Read each document number, parties, instrument type, and property schedule. Get certified copies for the underlying text.

00:00:18.917 --> 00:00:28.417
A no-entry result for 2019 to 2024 cannot explain a deed from 2012 or every private agreement.

00:00:28.417 --> 00:00:37.625
Build the chronology and compare it with one B, survey, and restrictions. Seek qualified review for conflicting agreements.
